// `axiomc lsp` CLI Driver Entrypoint & JSON-RPC Event Loop Router (T802 / E19.1).
// Implements SPEC-100 §8 (AXS-LSP-070..071; REQ-TOOL-183, REQ-TOOL-185, REQ-TOOL-300):
// - CLI flags: `--stdio`, `--position-encoding=utf-16|utf-8`, `--inlay-types=true|false`,
//   `--inlay-params=true|false`, `--inlay-ownership=true|false`, `--inlay-async=true|false`,
//   `--version`, `--help`.
// - Event-loop dispatch over `LspServerSession` (`compiler.lsp.protocol`),
//   `VfsWorkspace` (`compiler.lsp.vfs`), and `LspSemanticEngine` (`compiler.lsp.handlers`).
// - Enforces `AXS-LSP-004` (`REQ-TOOL-185`): zero mandatory backend codegen (`LIR`/`x86-64`/`COFF`/`ELF`)
//   during interactive semantic IDE sessions.
module compiler.driver.lsp_cmd

